A||N||13||Taijiguy||I LOVE MY FIERO!!!!!!||||10||
Z||000000||Taijiguy||04-08-2001||04:09 PM||||Man..there are only a few things that feel so good! <BR>A beautiful day here in Columbus, spring has sprung with a vengeance. The sun is shining, and it's gotta be 80 degrees out. Killing time at hone, and decided to just take the GT out and stretch his legs. Ended up just driving aimlessly, and wound up in a shopping center to turn around, figured I'd drive through so I could look at myself in the windows (LOL admit it, you all do it too   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"> ) Man! The GM guys knew what they were doing when they designed this car! Even without having all the trim back on, or the clear applied yet, this is one beautiful piece of machinery. And the way the exhaust reverbs against those brick walls. Yeehaw boys and girls, we're having some fun now! On another thread someone talked about lashing out if he felt someone was attacking his car. Lemme tell you, these cars speak for themselves, you could no way defend them any better than they defend themselves. Anyone who attacks the styling knows he's talking doo-doo before the words ever leaves his mouth! These are gorgeous, fun cars we drive.     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>~Taiji<P><p>[This message has been edited by Taijiguy (edited 04-08-2001).]||||reg||10
Z||000001||Cozmo||04-08-2001||04:21 PM||||Man, you're giving up our secrets!<BR>I've just been polishing up the Duke and thinking the same thing...<BR>These beloved Fieros are "eye candy"...<BR>(sniff) emotional moment <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>C02M0<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Formula88||04-08-2001||05:35 PM||||I know what you mean. I just finished putting the 3rd coat of wax (ok, only one coat each of cleaner, polish, and wax - but it looks GOOD) on my 88 Formula and its about 80 and sunny - so it's out with the sunroof and time to cruise before the pollen kills it.  If I can scam a digi camera, I'll post some pics.  No time for that right now, gotta DRIVE!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||10
Z||000003||fierofreek2001||04-08-2001||05:37 PM||||dude, for real! this is the nicest weekend EVER .. i love this time of year, the ol fiero got a REAL good clean up this weekend, and right now im in the process of doing the carpeting in black!... thats whats so great about these cars, you can do soo much modifying!  <BR>and you know, this forum makes me love my fieros even MORE, cuz its cool to see how many people have the same ideas and interests!!  <BR>well... thats all i have to say<BR>cya<BR>steve||||reg||1
Z||000004||firstfiero||04-08-2001||05:40 PM||||      I hear ya!! I just got back from cleaning my car, polishing my engine and just blasting down the back roads. It's 70 something out and damn...IS IT SPORTS CAR WEATHER OR WHAT...  <BR>      And yes I look at my self in the windows at shopping center. The fiero is like a beautiful women....YA GOTTA LOOK! <BR>     As a matter of fact is fact it's still sunny out...what the hell am I doing inside....TIME FOR ANOTHER RUN!!!!<BR><P>------------------<BR>Hey Mr. Ricer come over here and tell me how your stickers make you faster.....<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headshot.gif"> <BR>Todd <BR>  86se||||reg||6
