Z||000006||Taijiguy||04-08-2001||07:20 PM||||Tsk. What are people thinking sometimes...I go out on another little stint to get some nibbles. I'm at a light, and up comes some backwards hat boy in a Dodge Neon R/T (what the hell is that anyway??) So he looks over at me, and starts revving his four banger. I'm just sitting there shaking my head, thinking some people got the brain functions of broccoli. The light flips green, and he floors it. Chirps the tires. I wasn't even in a big hurry, I let him get a couple car lengths on me, and thought, "aww, what the hell" so I hammered it, by the time I cleared second I was even with him, and his motor was just SCREAMING, whenI hit third, he was so painfully beat I just shut it down, there was no point in even  continuing. <BR>Well, I had to do it....you know he would have gone home and jumped on his "Neon Lovers" website and claimed me as a kill. No way I could let THAT happen. ||||reg||1
Z||000007||rogergarrison||04-08-2001||08:28 PM||||Know what you mean tai. I had my car all cleaned up extra nice this morning, even pulled the wheels and cleaned everything. After the Nascar race, had to go out too. I just took rt3 and rt 62 up past Mt Vernon and back for last 3 hours.......so much fun. I love hearing that littl turbo engine whine out, honking at the people sitting on porches waving or giving thumbs up. One guy in a big old town car was going like 45 mph and everyone else like me about 65, went to pass him and he sped up (hate those assholes) so I couldnt get around. Lmao as I pulled beside him and nailed it.......gone. Now for some pizza and beer.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=9116379&p=34556781"> ||||reg||1
