Z||000009||DavidHenshaw||04-08-2001||09:40 PM||||OK. Here's the deal. If its a nice day in Columbus you have to drive to Granville which is about 40 miles east of the city. Very nice little town surrounded by great roads. Then you go about 10 miles north north\west to Willow Hills Winery. Their tasting deck overlooks a beautiful lake and the wine is very good. Been there a couple times, its worth the trip.<P>Dave<P>86 GT ||||reg||1
